<Page
	title="About Us"
	description="SpaceNews is an independent space news publication covering missions, technology, astronomy, and exploration."
	eyebrow="Who We Are"
>
	<p>
		<strong>SpaceNews</strong> is an independent publication dedicated to one of humanity's greatest
		adventures: the exploration of space. From rocket launches and space station operations to
		deep-space science and the race back to the Moon, we cover the missions, machines, and
		discoveries shaping our future beyond Earth.
	</p>

	<h2>What We Cover</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Missions</strong> — launches, landings, space station operations, and deep-space
			voyages.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Technology</strong> — rockets, spacecraft, satellites, spacesuits, and the engineering
			behind them.
		</li>
		<li><strong>Astronomy</strong> — telescopes, exoplanets, galaxies, and cosmic discoveries.</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Exploration</strong> — the Moon, Mars, and humanity's long-term future in space.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Our Editorial Standards</h2>
	<p>
		Space is complicated, and so is reporting on it. We hold ourselves to a simple standard: get
		the facts right, show our work, and fix our mistakes.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Accuracy first.</strong> We base our reporting on primary sources — space agencies,
			official mission updates, peer-reviewed research, and direct statements — wherever possible.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Clear sourcing.</strong> When we cite a claim, we tell you where it came from so you
			can check it yourself.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Corrections.</strong> When we get something wrong, we correct it promptly and
			transparently. If you spot an error, please <a href="/contact">let us know</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>No hype without evidence.</strong> We distinguish between what has happened, what is
			planned, and what is merely hoped for — especially with launch dates.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Images</h2>
	<p>
		Photography on SpaceNews comes from <a href="https://unsplash.com" rel="noopener">Unsplash</a>,
		unless otherwise credited. We aim to illustrate every story with imagery that is beautiful,
		relevant, and honestly captioned.
	</p>

	<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
	<p>
		Have a news tip, a correction, or just want to talk about space? We'd love to hear from you —
		head over to our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
	</p>
</Page>
